{"type":"message","id":"4520c16b","parentId":"202eceaf","timestamp":"2026-05-27T06:22:55.194Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Wed 2026-05-27 06:22 UTC] [Subagent Context] You are running as a subagent (depth 1/1). Results auto-announce to your requester; do not busy-poll for status.\n\n[Subagent Task]: REVISION MODE — Structure/anchor only.\nRead /tmp/crypto-run-20260527-061625/article/final.md (validated baseline).\nFix only: ARTICLE_INVALID: expected 3-6 H3 subsections (###), found 0\nDo NOT full-rewrite. Preserve body length within ±50 words of the baseline unless fixing anchors requires minimal edits.\n\nRe-read /tmp/crypto-run-20260527-061625/research/validated.json and COINOGRAPHY_TEMPLATE.md before writing.\n\nFull contract (all rules apply — do not skip any):\n- H1: SEO title using primary_keyword from validated.json; topic must clearly match research.\n- Structure: within borders — H2 body sections 2-4, H3 subsections 3-6, FAQ items 3-6; ## Conclusion then ## FAQs last before Sources.\n- Links: exactly 2 distinct source anchors in hook/first H2 only (URLs from source_urls in validated.json).\n- Footer: **Sources:** with URL bullets; final line [Word Count: NNNN] — N must come from count_article_body_words.py (never guess).\n- Length: 1000–1200 body words (aim 1100).\n- META: SEO Title ≤55 chars, URL Slug ≤70 chars, Meta Description ≤155 chars (count before writing).\n- Before SUCCESS: python3 ~/.openclaw/workspace-orchestrator/skills/pipeline/count_article_body_words.py --path /tmp/crypto-run-20260527-061625/article/raw.md\n- Write the full article to /tmp/crypto-run-20260527-061625/article/raw.md. Yield SUCCESS only."}],"timestamp":1779862975184}}
